Verification.compute_correct : ∀ (self : adler2.Adler32) (bytes : Aeneas.Std.Slice Aeneas.Std.U8),
  Aeneas.Std.WP.spec (adler2.algo.Adler32.compute self bytes) fun r =>
    (↑r.a, ↑r.b) = Verification.scalar (↑self.a, ↑self.b) ↑bytes
'Verification.compute_correct' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
